speechtext:
The names are as
follows:
Hon. R. B. Bennett, K.C., Calgary; Hon. Raoul Dandurand, V. M. Drury, Sir Lomer Gouin, G. H. Montgomery, K.C., J. W. McConnell, Hon. Donat Raymond, F. N. Southam, Hon. Smeaton White, Brigadier General J. B. WThite, all of Montreal;
Now laugh;
Gordon C. Edwards, M.P., Ottawa;
